IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg3-certificates`
IMPORT `dg3-transfers`

-- Tests of dg3-certificates.l4 (sections 167 and 168) and dg3-transfers.l4 (sections 201 and 202).
-- Every expected value was decided by reading the section, then written beside the assertion; none is copied from the encoding's output.

§ `Section 167: lost, stolen or destroyed certificates`

-- issued by the corporation and alleged to be lost, stolen or destroyed
#ASSERT `s 167 the corporation may issue a new certificate or uncertificated shares in place of the certificate` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 167 the corporation may issue a new certificate or uncertificated shares in place of the certificate` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 167 the corporation may issue a new certificate or uncertificated shares in place of the certificate` TRUE FALSE)
-- a bond may be required of the owner or the owner's legal representative
#ASSERT `s 167 the corporation may require the person to give a bond sufficient to indemnify it` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 167 the corporation may require the person to give a bond sufficient to indemnify it` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 167 the corporation may require the person to give a bond sufficient to indemnify it` FALSE TRUE)

§ `Section 168: judicial proceedings`

-- (a): the corporation refuses; the certificate was issued by it or its predecessor; alleged lost, stolen or destroyed; the applicant is the owner or the owner's representative
#ASSERT `s 168(a) the owner may apply to the Court of Chancery for an order to show cause` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 168(a) the owner may apply to the Court of Chancery for an order to show cause` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 168(a) the owner may apply to the Court of Chancery for an order to show cause` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 168(a) the owner may apply to the Court of Chancery for an order to show cause` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 168(a) the owner may apply to the Court of Chancery for an order to show cause` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- the complaint: the number and date of the certificate are required only if known or ascertainable by the plaintiff
#ASSERT `s 168(a) the complaint states what the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 168(a) the complaint states what the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 168(a) the complaint states what the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 168(a) the complaint states what the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 168(a) the complaint states what the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 168(a) the complaint states what the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- on such a complaint the court shall order the corporation to show cause
#ASSERT `s 168(a) the court shall make an order requiring the corporation to show cause` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 168(a) the court shall make an order requiring the corporation to show cause` FALSE)
-- service at least 5 days before the time designated (10 June 2026 less 5 days is 5 June 2026)
#ASSERT `s 168(a) the service on the corporation is timely` (YearMonthDay 2026 6 5) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 10)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 168(a) the service on the corporation is timely` (YearMonthDay 2026 6 6) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 10))
-- (b): the court is satisfied of ownership, of the loss, and that no sufficient cause has been shown
#ASSERT `s 168(b) the court shall order the corporation to issue and deliver new uncertificated shares or a new certificate to the plaintiff` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 168(b) the court shall order the corporation to issue and deliver new uncertificated shares or a new certificate to the plaintiff` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 168(b) the court shall order the corporation to issue and deliver new uncertificated shares or a new certificate to the plaintiff` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 168(b) the court shall order the corporation to issue and deliver new uncertificated shares or a new certificate to the plaintiff` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 168(b) the plaintiff must give the corporation a bond before the new uncertificated shares or certificate are issued and delivered` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 168(b) the plaintiff must give the corporation a bond before the new uncertificated shares or certificate are issued and delivered` FALSE)
-- the corporation is not liable beyond the amount specified in the bond
#ASSERT `s 168(b) the most the corporation is liable for on the claim` TRUE 1000 400 EQUALS JUST 400
#ASSERT `s 168(b) the most the corporation is liable for on the claim` TRUE 300 400 EQUALS JUST 300
#ASSERT `s 168(b) the most the corporation is liable for on the claim` FALSE 1000 400 EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 201: transfer of stock`

#ASSERT `s 201 what governs the transfer of the stock` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `Article 8 of subtitle I of Title 6 under s 201`
#ASSERT `s 201 what governs the transfer of the stock` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `this chapter under s 201`
#ASSERT `s 201 what governs the transfer of the stock` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `this chapter under s 201`
#ASSERT `s 201 what governs the transfer of the stock` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `this chapter under s 201`

§ `Section 202: restrictions on transfer and ownership of securities`

GIVEN written IS A BOOLEAN
      permitted IS A BOOLEAN
      certificated IS A BOOLEAN
      noted IS A BOOLEAN
      notice IS A BOOLEAN
      knows IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 202(a) Facts about a restriction and the person it is asserted against`
`dg3 test restriction` written permitted certificated noted notice knows MEANS
    `s 202(a) Facts about a restriction and the person it is asserted against` WITH
        `the restriction is written` IS written
        `the restriction is permitted by section 202` IS permitted
        `the restricted securities are represented by a certificate` IS certificated
        `the restriction is noted conspicuously on the certificate` IS noted
        `the restriction is contained in the notice given pursuant to section 151(f)` IS notice
        `the person has actual knowledge of the restriction` IS knows

-- certificated securities: noted conspicuously on the certificate
#ASSERT `s 202(a) the restriction may be enforced against the person` (`dg3 test restriction` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
-- not noted and no actual knowledge: ineffective
#ASSERT NOT (`s 202(a) the restriction may be enforced against the person` (`dg3 test restriction` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
-- not noted, but the person has actual knowledge: effective against that person
#ASSERT `s 202(a) the restriction may be enforced against the person` (`dg3 test restriction` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
-- a notice does not stand in for the note on a certificate
#ASSERT NOT (`s 202(a) the restriction may be enforced against the person` (`dg3 test restriction` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE))
-- uncertificated shares: contained in the notice under section 151(f)
#ASSERT `s 202(a) the restriction may be enforced against the person` (`dg3 test restriction` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 202(a) the restriction may be enforced against the person` (`dg3 test restriction` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT `s 202(a) the restriction may be enforced against the person` (`dg3 test restriction` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
-- not written, or not permitted by section 202: not enforceable under this subsection
#ASSERT NOT (`s 202(a) the restriction may be enforced against the person` (`dg3 test restriction` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 202(a) the restriction may be enforced against the person` (`dg3 test restriction` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
-- (b): how a restriction is imposed
#ASSERT `s 202(b) the restriction may be imposed in that way` `by the certificate of incorporation under s 202(b)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 202(b) the restriction may be imposed in that way` `by the bylaws under s 202(b)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 202(b) the restriction may be imposed in that way` `by an agreement among any number of security holders under s 202(b)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 202(b) the restriction may be imposed in that way` `by an agreement among such holders and the corporation under s 202(b)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 202(b) the restriction may be imposed in that way` `in another way under s 202(b)` EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b): securities issued before the restriction are bound only if their holders are parties to an agreement or voted in favor
#ASSERT `s 202(b) the restriction is binding with respect to the securities` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 202(b) the restriction is binding with respect to the securities` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 202(b) the restriction is binding with respect to the securities` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 202(b) the restriction is binding with respect to the securities` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

GIVEN offer IS A BOOLEAN
      reasonable IS A BOOLEAN
      purchase IS A BOOLEAN
      consent IS A BOOLEAN
      sell IS A BOOLEAN
      designated IS A BOOLEAN
      unreasonable IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 202(c) The kind of restriction`
`dg3 test kind` offer reasonable purchase consent sell designated unreasonable MEANS
    `s 202(c) The kind of restriction` WITH
        `it obligates the holder to offer to the corporation, other holders or any other person, or any combination, a prior opportunity to acquire the restricted securities` IS offer
        `that opportunity is to be exercised within a reasonable time` IS reasonable
        `it obligates the corporation, a holder or any other person, or any combination, to purchase the securities that are the subject of an agreement respecting their purchase and sale` IS purchase
        `it requires the corporation or the holders of any class or series to consent to a proposed transfer, to approve the proposed transferee, or to approve the amount of securities that may be owned` IS consent
        `it obligates the holder to sell or transfer an amount of the restricted securities, or causes or results in their automatic sale or transfer` IS sell
        `it prohibits or restricts the transfer to, or the ownership by, designated persons or classes of persons or groups of persons` IS designated
        `the designation is manifestly unreasonable` IS unreasonable

-- (c)(1) a prior opportunity to acquire, to be exercised within a reasonable time
#ASSERT `s 202(c) the restriction is of a kind that section 202 permits` (`dg3 test kind` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 202(c) the restriction is of a kind that section 202 permits` (`dg3 test kind` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
-- (c)(2) an obligation to purchase; (3) consent or approval; (4) an obligation to sell or an automatic sale
#ASSERT `s 202(c) the restriction is of a kind that section 202 permits` (`dg3 test kind` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 202(c) the restriction is of a kind that section 202 permits` (`dg3 test kind` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 202(c) the restriction is of a kind that section 202 permits` (`dg3 test kind` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
-- (c)(5) designated persons, not manifestly unreasonable
#ASSERT `s 202(c) the restriction is of a kind that section 202 permits` (`dg3 test kind` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 202(c) the restriction is of a kind that section 202 permits` (`dg3 test kind` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE))
-- none of the five kinds
#ASSERT NOT (`s 202(c) the restriction is of a kind that section 202 permits` (`dg3 test kind` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE))

GIVEN tax IS A BOOLEAN
      sCorp IS A BOOLEAN
      attribute IS A BOOLEAN
      reit IS A BOOLEAN
      regulatory IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 202(d) The purpose of a restriction`
`dg3 test purpose` tax sCorp attribute reit regulatory MEANS
    `s 202(d) The purpose of a restriction` WITH
        `maintaining a local, state, federal or foreign tax advantage to the corporation or its stockholders` IS tax
        `maintaining the corporation's status as an electing small business corporation under subchapter S of the United States Internal Revenue Code` IS sCorp
        `maintaining or preserving a tax attribute, including net operating losses` IS attribute
        `qualifying or maintaining the qualification of the corporation as a real estate investment trust under the United States Internal Revenue Code` IS reit
        `maintaining a statutory or regulatory advantage or complying with a statutory or regulatory requirement under applicable local, state, federal or foreign law` IS regulatory

#ASSERT `s 202(d) the restriction is conclusively presumed to be for a reasonable purpose` (`dg3 test purpose` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 202(d) the restriction is conclusively presumed to be for a reasonable purpose` (`dg3 test purpose` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 202(d) the restriction is conclusively presumed to be for a reasonable purpose` (`dg3 test purpose` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 202(d) the restriction is conclusively presumed to be for a reasonable purpose` (`dg3 test purpose` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 202(d) the restriction is conclusively presumed to be for a reasonable purpose` (`dg3 test purpose` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- none of the listed purposes: the subsection does not presume the purpose unreasonable
#ASSERT `s 202(d) the restriction is conclusively presumed to be for a reasonable purpose` (`dg3 test purpose` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (e): any other lawful restriction is permitted
#ASSERT `s 202(e) the restriction is permitted by section 202` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 202(e) the restriction is permitted by section 202` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 202(e) the restriction is permitted by section 202` FALSE FALSE)
